    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾰληριάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be patched with white,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματα φαληριόωντα</span> waves
				<i>crested with white foam,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.799
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαληριῶσαν σπίλον</span>”
				<i>white with breakers,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					188
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. στόρθυγξ</span>”
				<i>white with foam,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					491
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθον λευκὰ φαληριόωντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					3.79
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i>).</div>
